LibreMobileNetV4 — third-party attribution
==========================================

The MobileNetV4 architecture in this family (``nn.py``) is a native
re-implementation derived from the MobileNetV4 implementation in
`timm` (PyTorch Image Models):

    Source:   https://github.com/huggingface/pytorch-image-models
    Files:    timm/models/mobilenetv3.py, timm/models/_efficientnet_blocks.py,
              timm/models/_efficientnet_builder.py
    Author:   Ross Wightman and the timm contributors
    License:  Apache License 2.0

The block definitions, per-variant architecture strings, channel-rounding,
and module/attribute naming follow timm so that timm's Apache-2.0
ImageNet-1k pretrained weights load unchanged and produce bit-identical
inference output (verified by the parity test).

Pretrained weights (mobilenetv4_conv_{small,medium,large}, ImageNet-1k,
trained by Ross Wightman in timm — no distillation, no extra data) are
licensed Apache-2.0 and are redistributable for commercial use.

